This is a native Julia implementation of the Differential Algebra Core Engine (DACE).

The original DACE software includes work developed at:
- Dinamica Srl in 2014 (DACE 1.0 Core and C++ interface)
- Politecnico di Milano and ESA ACT in 2016 (improved Core)

Original DACE 1.0 development at Dinamica Srl (2014):
Under ESA Contract "Nonlinear Propagation of Uncertainties in Space Dynamics based on Taylor Differential Algebra"
